{0 cairo records}

{!Occairo} has one module for each cairo record, with the externals they are built on in {!Occairo.Raw} and the enumerations and bitfields in {!Occairo.Enums}. See {%html:<a href="../ocgtk/conventions.html">the conventions page</a>%} for how the bindings are organised: the two layers, the anatomy of a class module, and how names, types, signals and properties are mapped.

{1 Records}

